{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Herding Ain\u2019t Easy, It's Chaotic!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your herd is clueless, clumsy, and constantly in danger\u2014but it\u2019s up to you to get them to their destination! In <i>The Herd</i>, you\u2019ll guide a stampede of not-so-bright animals through a world filled with <strong>ridiculous hazards, sneaky predators, and total mayhem.</strong> Use a variety of wacky tools to steer them clear of danger, or just embrace the chaos and see what happens!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Herd-Wranglin' Gadgets:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude80 <strong>Launch Pad</strong> \u2013 Some herd members need a little \u201cmotivation.\u201d Fling them across obstacles and take control of their fate\u2014whether they like it or not!<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/herdgif-launch-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744814887\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd25 <strong>Fire</strong> \u2013 Your animals might not be bright, but this fire sure is, and the herd will tend to avoid it. Use it to steer them in the right direction (or just wreak havoc on the environment and watch the ensuing chaos).<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/herdgif-fire-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744814887\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf1 <strong>Wall</strong> \u2013 Herd bouncing off in all directions? Plop down a wall to rebound them into submission!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/herdgif-wall-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744814887\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udca8 <strong>Fan</strong> \u2013 Need a little extra push? Give your herd a gusty nudge with a well-placed fan.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/herdgifwnd-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744814887\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udea7 <strong>Fence</strong> \u2013 Solid objects are scary. Block the wrong paths and funnel your herd where you actually want them to go!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc15 <strong>Dog</strong> \u2013 Nothing clears a crowd like a barking dog! Use these feisty puppers to spook your herd into moving in the right direction.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/extras/herdifdog-ezgif.com-video-to-gif-converter.gif?t=1744814887\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Herd Mode</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take on <strong>randomly generated levels</strong> in this roguelike-inspired mode! Grow your herd, dodge hazards, and see just how big (or how small) your herd ends up by the end.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Try the Demo!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Get a taste of the chaos with <strong>seven playable levels</strong>! The full game will include <strong>even more levels, Herd Mode, and a wide variety of goofy animals\u2014each with their own ridiculous quirks!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2933210?t=1744814887","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2933210?t=1744814887","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/20df6c5721de82b607e6aa95d7d60d30506a8151/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744814887","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2933210/20df6c5721de82b607e6aa95d7d60d30506a8151/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744814887","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Family Sharing","